---
// Single sentence + tilted HUD showing screen reading capability
---

<section
  id="le-a-tela"
  class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-paper/10"
  aria-labelledby="le-a-tela-titulo"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-32 md:py-40">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      {/* Copy */}
      <div data-reveal>
        <h2
          id="le-a-tela-titulo"
          class="font-display text-4xl font-black leading-tight text-paper md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
        >
          Ele lê a sua tela
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-paper/70 md:text-xl">
          Além de ouvir, Pitchei enxerga o que aparece na sua tela: um código, uma planilha, uma pergunta compartilhada. Aperte o atalho e ele responde na hora.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Tilted HUD visual */}
      <div class="relative" data-reveal>
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-12 -z-10 rounded-[3rem] opacity-60"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, rgba(232,93,38,0.18), transparent 70%);"
        ></div>

        {/* Screen capture window, slightly rotated */}
        <div
          class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-paper/10 shadow-overlay"
          style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2A1810 0%, #1C0F09 100%); transform: rotate(-1.5deg);"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-paper/10 bg-paper/[0.03] px-4 py-3">
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF5F57]"></span>
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FEBC2E]"></span>
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#28C840]"></span>
            <span class="ml-3 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-paper/45">
              Tela compartilhada
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/40">
              Na tela
            </p>
            <div class="mt-3 rounded-xl border border-paper/10 bg-paper/[0.03] p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/80 md:text-sm">
              <span class="text-paper/40">// Given an array, return the length of the</span><br />
              <span class="text-paper/40">// longest subarray with sum ≤ k.</span><br />
              <span class="text-orange">function</span> <span class="text-paper">maxLen</span>(nums, k) &#123; ... &#125;
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Pitchei answer overlay, slightly rotated opposite direction */}
        <div
          class="relative -mt-8 ml-auto w-[90%] rounded-2xl border border-orange/45 p-6 shadow-[0_0_42px_rgba(232,93,38,0.16)] backdrop-blur-overlay md:p-8"
          style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(232,93,38,0.12), rgba(28,15,9,0.85)); transform: rotate(1deg);"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs">
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2">
              <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-pulse-soft rounded-full" style="background: #FF7A45"></span>
              <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full" style="background: #FF7A45"></span>
            </span>
            <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange">
              Pitchei leu a tela
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper md:text-base">
            Use dois ponteiros com uma janela deslizante: expanda à direita somando <code class="font-mono text-orange">nums[r]</code>, e encolha pela esquerda enquanto a soma passar de <code class="font-mono text-orange">k</code>. O maior <code class="font-mono text-orange">r − l + 1</code> é a resposta. O(n).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
